            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Most household junk, construction debris, demolition debris, furniture, roofing materials, and yard debris are accepted. Additional charges apply for mattresses, tires, and certain special disposal items. We cannot accept hazardous materials, paint, oils, chemicals, batteries, propane tanks, asbestos, refrigerators containing refrigerant, or other prohibited items. If you're unsure about an item, just ask." data-es="Se acepta la mayoría de la basura del hogar, escombros de construcción, escombros de demolición, muebles, materiales de techo y escombros de jardín. Aplican cargos adicionales por colchones, llantas y ciertos artículos de desecho especial. No podemos aceptar materiales peligrosos, pintura, aceites, químicos, baterías, tanques de propano, asbesto, refrigeradores que contengan refrigerante u otros artículos prohibidos. Si tienes dudas sobre algún artículo, solo pregúntanos.">Most household junk, construction debris, demolition debris, furniture, roofing materials, and yard debris are accepted. Additional charges apply for mattresses, tires, and certain special disposal items. We cannot accept hazardous materials, paint, oils, chemicals, batteries, propane tanks, asbestos, refrigerators containing refrigerant, or other prohibited items. If you're unsure about an item, just ask.</div>
          </details>
