            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Permits are generally only required if the dumpster will be placed on a public street or right-of-way. Permit requirements vary by jurisdiction. Please contact your local city or county permitting office to determine whether a permit is required for your project." data-es="Por lo general, solo se requiere un permiso si el contenedor se colocará en una calle pública o en la vía pública. Los requisitos de permisos varían según la jurisdicción. Por favor comunícate con la oficina de permisos de tu ciudad o condado para determinar si se requiere un permiso para tu proyecto.">Permits are generally only required if the dumpster will be placed on a public street or right-of-way. Permit requirements vary by jurisdiction. Please contact your local city or county permitting office to determine whether a permit is required for your project.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="How long can I keep the dumpster?" data-es="¿Cuánto tiempo puedo quedarme con el contenedor?">How long can I keep the dumpster?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Need more time? Additional rental days are available for an additional charge. When you're finished, simply call to schedule pickup." data-es="¿Necesitas más tiempo? Hay días de renta adicionales disponibles por un cargo adicional. Cuando termines, solo llámanos para programar la recogida.">Need more time? Additional rental days are available for an additional charge. When you're finished, simply call to schedule pickup.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="Will the dumpster damage my driveway?" data-es="¿El contenedor dañará mi entrada?">Will the dumpster damage my driveway?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Dumpster weight, weather conditions, and surface conditions can affect driveways and other surfaces. Customers who wish to protect their driveway should place boards or other protective materials where the dumpster will be set. Please let us know if you have concerns about placement before delivery." data-es="El peso del contenedor, las condiciones del clima y las condiciones de la superficie pueden afectar las entradas y otras superficies. Los clientes que quieran proteger su entrada deben colocar tablas u otros materiales protectores donde se colocará el contenedor. Por favor avísanos si tienes inquietudes sobre la colocación antes de la entrega.">Dumpster weight, weather conditions, and surface conditions can affect driveways and other surfaces. Customers who wish to protect their driveway should place boards or other protective materials where the dumpster will be set. Please let us know if you have concerns about placement before delivery.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="How much can I load it?" data-es="¿Cuánto puedo cargarlo?">How much can I load it?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Each dumpster includes a specified weight allowance based on the container size and material type. For safety and transportation regulations, debris must not extend above the top edge of the container. Aggregate materials such as concrete, dirt, brick, and asphalt have separate loading requirements and must remain below the top rail of the container. Contact us if you're unsure which dumpster is right for your project." data-es="Cada contenedor incluye un límite de peso específico según el tamaño del contenedor y el tipo de material. Por seguridad y por regulaciones de transporte, los escombros no deben sobrepasar el borde superior del contenedor. Los materiales agregados como concreto, tierra, ladrillo y asfalto tienen requisitos de carga distintos y deben quedar por debajo del riel superior del contenedor. Comunícate con nosotros si no estás seguro de cuál contenedor es el adecuado para tu proyecto.">Each dumpster includes a specified weight allowance based on the container size and material type. For safety and transportation regulations, debris must not extend above the top edge of the container. Aggregate materials such as concrete, dirt, brick, and asphalt have separate loading requirements and must remain below the top rail of the container. Contact us if you're unsure which dumpster is right for your project.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary data-en="How much space do you need?" data-es="¿Cuánto espacio necesitan?">How much space do you need?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Our trucks generally require a minimum of 44 feet of straight-line access to safely place a dumpster. We also operate smaller trucks that can accommodate tighter spaces. If your driveway, alley, or job site has limited access, please let us know when scheduling so we can recommend the best option. Please also ensure there is adequate overhead clearance from trees, wires, or other obstacles." data-es="Nuestros camiones generalmente requieren un mínimo de 44 pies de acceso en línea recta para colocar un contenedor de forma segura. También operamos camiones más pequeños que se adaptan a espacios más reducidos. Si tu entrada, callejón o sitio de trabajo tiene acceso limitado, por favor avísanos al programar para recomendarte la mejor opción. Asegúrate también de que haya suficiente espacio libre por encima, sin árboles, cables u otros obstáculos.">Our trucks generally require a minimum of 44 feet of straight-line access to safely place a dumpster. We also operate smaller trucks that can accommodate tighter spaces. If your driveway, alley, or job site has limited access, please let us know when scheduling so we can recommend the best option. Please also ensure there is adequate overhead clearance from trees, wires, or other obstacles.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
