            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="We accept credit cards, debit cards, and ACH payments. Payment is collected before delivery." data-es="Aceptamos tarjetas de crédito, tarjetas de débito y pagos ACH. El pago se cobra antes de la entrega.">We accept credit cards, debit cards, and ACH payments. Payment is collected before delivery.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
