            <div class="faq-answer" data-en="Please contact us as soon as possible if your plans change. Orders canceled or rescheduled before dispatch are generally not subject to additional fees. If the truck has already been dispatched or is on-site, a trip charge will apply." data-es="Por favor comunícate con nosotros lo antes posible si tus planes cambian. Las órdenes canceladas o reprogramadas antes del despacho generalmente no están sujetas a cargos adicionales. Si el camión ya fue despachado o está en el sitio, se aplicará un cargo por viaje.">Please contact us as soon as possible if your plans change. Orders canceled or rescheduled before dispatch are generally not subject to additional fees. If the truck has already been dispatched or is on-site, a trip charge will apply.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

